Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.19,0:08:34.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnYusei Magic}もし ｷﾐが勝てば{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡\N{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果你赢了{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}➡
